strict and Sessions Courts. GOVERNMENT OF NCT OF DELHI Delhi Subordinate Services Selection Board (D.S.S.S.B) FC-18, INSTITUTIONAL AREA, KARKARDOOMA, DELHI-110092 Website: https://dsssb.delhi.gov.in Page 2 of 23 Further, candidates are advised to visit website of the Board and Delhi District Courts on regular basis to get updates. The Board shall not be responsible for any lapse on the part of the candidate in this regard. IMPORTANT NOTE:- The candidates must submit their application through Online Mode only. No o",
